id=hypercameramod
name=HyperCameraMod (LUT stage)
version=1.1.0-262-preview-read
versionCode=262
author=rezikham
description=LUT stage build. Stages the authentic 17U M3 Monopan and M9 Leica Natural LUTs plus the Camera 5.3 film-filter LUTs (600F, BF70, R600, P100F, F-50, KC64, V250, H400, KP160, FC400, C-50D, KG200) at /data/vendor/camera and enables camera.debug.mivi3.output.jpeg. Contains NO libraries, NO plugin mounts, NO /odm or /vendor modifications, and does NOT install the APK.
